                    "body": "Yes, it has to determine that, but also some other things (like indent string of lines to be used).\r\n\r\nYes, it is possible.\r\n\r\nNo, I don't think it is a good idea. It will lead to increase of supported code/tests/documentations and I don't really want to do that (given overall) growth of 'mini.nvim'.",
